 "conf": 0.94, "box": [[59, 1004], [839, 1013], [839, 1040], [59, 1030]]}, {"text": "and peridot. In Pakistan Peshawar is the main centre for gemstone trading and business. Pakistan", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[60, 1030], [840, 1037], [840, 1063], [60, 1057]]}, {"text": "earnforeignexchangebyexportingpreciousgems inrawandfinishedform.", "conf": 0.945, "box": [[61, 1059], [676, 1063], [676, 1086], [61, 1082]]}, {"text": "Balochistan is also rich in precious stones and minerals.Rek o Diq has a large copper and gold", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[61, 1090], [840, 1095], [840, 1118], [61, 1113]]}, {"text": "deposits in the Chaghidistrict of Balochistan.", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[63, 1117], [444, 1117], [444, 1141], [63, 1141]]}, {"text": "72", "conf": 0.646, "box": [[455, 1176], [481, 1176], [481, 1198], [455, 1198]]}, {"text": "Unit 6:Mineralsand PowerResources", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[610, 1172], [844, 1174], [844, 1194], [610, 1192]]}]}